From: liuqin Fedora adaptation <liuqin@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] liuqin 7.3.1: restore-ipcc

Revert 0012; restore upstream IPCC IRQF_NO_SUSPEND; pair with battmgr wakeup filtering.
Linux-derived code retains original GPL notices. Offline port; no hardware claim.
---
--- a/drivers/mailbox/qcom-ipcc.c
+++ b/drivers/mailbox/qcom-ipcc.c
@@ -328,7 +328,7 @@
 		goto err_mbox;
 
 	ret = devm_request_irq(&pdev->dev, ipcc->irq, qcom_ipcc_irq_fn,
-			       IRQF_TRIGGER_HIGH |
+			       IRQF_TRIGGER_HIGH | IRQF_NO_SUSPEND |
 			       IRQF_NO_THREAD, name, ipcc);
 	if (ret < 0)
 		goto err_req_irq;
